  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building and Establishment of Research Consortium</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">strengthen the existing collaboration between the partner institutions in the field of nanomaterials for energy technologies and to establish a clean energy consortium that includes private enterprises from Norway and Sri Lanka.</narrative>
